General advice (i.e. blather to cover up that trying to read
your paragraph upon paragraph of inventory game me a headache:):

  Carry the wand of wishing with you.  (Do NOT put it in your
bag of holding.)  If you get into a situation where a wish 
can't save you, you're probably doing something wrong.

  If you don't recognize *when* you're in a situation where you
need to use a wish, you don't have the necessary skills to 
win at Nethack.

  There are very few situations with only one possible solution.
(See the Medusa crossing spoiler, or the ways of removing cursed
ring/boots of levitation.)  

  Stare at your inventory for a while every so often.  Think of 
what you can do with each item.  It's a truism that most 
characters die with something that could have saved them in 
inventory.

  

